      "claim": "The doctor's oral instruction to the nurse was not the proximate cause of the patient's death.",
      "evidence": "The nurse correctly transmitted the order for A-positive blood to the blood bank, and the blood bank staff correctly recorded the order. The error occurred later in the blood bank's internal process of filling and labeling the blood.",
